---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---
<Base title="这一页走丢了" noindex><section class="not-found wrap"><p class="eyebrow">404 · A LITTLE DETOUR</p><Icon name="leaf" size={48} /><h1>好像，走岔了一条小路。</h1><p>这一页不存在，或者已经搬走了。<br />没关系，回到熟悉的地方再逛逛。</p><a class="button primary" href={withBase('/', import.meta.env.BASE_URL)}>回到首页 <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a></section></Base>
